 "of intelligent extraterrestrial", "x": 76.79, "y": 12.94, "w": 17.95, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "life being forthcoming by the", "x": 76.82, "y": 14.23, "w": 18.81, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "UK Prime Minister before the", "x": 76.94, "y": 15.53, "w": 18.72, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "end of 2004 from 500/1 to", "x": 76.79, "y": 16.83, "w": 16.63, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "100/1.", "x": 76.88, "y": 17.93, "w": 3.98, "h": 1.34, "fontSize": 9.9}, {"text": "25 December 2003", "x": 89.04, "y": 19.2, "w": 7.17, "h": 0.7, "fontSize": 5.2}, {"text": "RUSSIA:", "x": 76.76, "y": 20.6, "w": 6.71, "h": 1.69, "fontSize": 12.4}, {"text": "UFO MOBILISES", "x": 76.79, "y": 22.16, "w": 14.42, "h": 1.92, "fontSize": 14.1}, {"text": "CIVIL DEFENCE", "x": 76.73, "y": 23.82, "w": 13.61, "h": 1.92, "fontSize": 14.1}, {"text": "MOSCOW, 29 (ANSA) -", "x": 76.73, "y": 26.28, "w": 15.27, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Russian Civil Defence", "x": 76.76, "y": 27.55, "w": 15.06, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "authorities sent a helicopter", "x": 76.66, "y": 28.83, "w": 19.06, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "to the Russian Siberian", "x": 76.6, "y": 30.11, "w": 16.13, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "region of Kemerovo, whose", "x": 76.73, "y": 31.38, "w": 18.93, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "inhabitants claimed having", "x": 76.69, "y": 32.66, "w": 18.43, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "seen an unidentified flying", "x": 76.63, "y": 33.94, "w": 18.16, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "object which gave the", "x": 76.66, "y": 35.21, "w": 15.12, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "impression of having \"land-", "x": 76.69, "y": 36.49, "w": 18.63, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "ed\".", "x": 76.66, "y": 37.77, "w": 2.98, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Regional authorities quoted", "x": 76.73, "y": 40.34, "w": 18.98, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "by the Itar-Tass news", "x": 76.66, "y": 41.6, "w": 14.67, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "agency explained that in the", "x": 76.6, "y": 42.85, "w": 19.33, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "early hours of December 26,", "x": 76.66, "y": 44.11, "w": 19.34, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "residents of the city of", "x": 76.6, "y": 45.36, "w": 15.38, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Gurievsk followed the", "x": 76.66, "y": 46.62, "w": 15.03, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "manouveres of a UFO for", "x": 76.69, "y": 47.87, "w": 17.31, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "over half an hour. The", "x": 76.66, "y": 49.13, "w": 15.06, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "object, which had the", "x": 76.63, "y": 50.38, "w": 14.76, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "appearance of a fireball,", "x": 76.63, "y": 51.64, "w": 16.5, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "eventually fell to earth.", "x": 76.63, "y": 52.89, "w": 15.56, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "According to eyewitness", "x": 76.63, "y": 55.6, "w": 17.06, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "accounts, no explosions", "x": 76.66, "y": 56.85, "w": 16.85, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "were heard, nor were any", "x": 76.6, "y": 58.11, "w": 17.45, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "reports of fires or toppled", "x": 76.66, "y": 59.36, "w": 17.56, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "trees received, as seems to", "x": 76.6, "y": 60.62, "w": 18.78, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "occur whenever a meteorite", "x": 76.63, "y": 61.87, "w": 19.12, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "is involved.", "x": 76.73, "y": 63.13, "w": 7.96, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "SOURCE: ANSA News Agency", "x": 82.08, "y": 65.09, "w": 13.86, "h": 0.7, "fontSize": 5.2}, {"text": "Mysterious", "x": 8.41, "y": 68.18, "w": 18.62, "h": 3.85, "fontSize": 28.4}, {"text": "Red", "x": 27.03, "y": 68.18, "w": 7.81, "h": 3.85, "fontSize": 28.5}, {"text": "Light Prompts Coastguard Scramble", "x": 34.84, "y": 68.18, "w": 63.29, "h": 3.85, "fontSize": 28.4}, {"text": "14 November 2003", "x": 8.02, "y": 72.61, "w": 11.02, "h": 1.11, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "H", "x": 26.58, "y": 72.61, "w": 0.81, "h": 1.11, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "M", "x": 28.46, "y": 72.61, "w": 0.93, "h": 1.11, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "P", "x": 30.47, "y": 72.61, "w": 0.75, "h": 1.11, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "I", "x": 32.29, "y": 72.61, "w": 0.31, "h": 1.11, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "H", "x": 33.68, "y": 72.61, "w": 0.81, "h": 1.11, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "B", "x": 35.57, "y": 72.61, "w": 1.12, "h": 1.11, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Coastguard rescue teams were I", "x": 7.99, "y": 73.83, "w": 19.07, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "scrambled after a strange red |", "x": 7.99, "y": 75.02, "w": 18.23, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "light was reported off the coast fl", "x": 8.02, "y": 76.21, "w": 19.04, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "of Stonehaven on the evening", "x": 7.99, "y": 77.4, "w": 16.6, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "K", "x": 25.91, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.91, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "j", "x": 27.27, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.31, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "f", "x": 28.02, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.38, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "t", "x": 28.84, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.38, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "i", "x": 29.67, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.31, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "j", "x": 30.42, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.31, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "^", "x": 31.18, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.64, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "^", "x": 32.26, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.64, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "p", "x": 33.35, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.76, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": ".", "x": 34.55, "y": 77.4, "w": 0.74, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "of November 13 2003.", "x": 7.99, "y": 78.6, "w": 12.55, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "^", "x": 25.42, "y": 78.6, "w": 1.0, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "A report was received of what was thought to be a", "x": 7.96, "y": 80.98, "w": 28.21, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "red distress flare over the water off Garron Point", "x": 8.02, "y": 82.15, "w": 26.53, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "near Cowie just after 7pm. Two maritime Rescue", "x": 8.02, "y": 83.32, "w": 26.98, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "International Lifeboats were launched and the coast", "x": 8.02, "y": 84.49, "w": 28.52, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "guard search team were called but found no sign of", "x": 8.02, "y": 85.66, "w": 28.48, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "a boat or swimmer in distress.", "x": 8.02, "y": 86.83, "w": 16.97, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Calls were made to", "x": 8.02, "y": 89.32, "w": 10.53, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Aberdeen", "x": 18.55, "y": 89.32, "w": 5.55, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Airport", "x": 24.1, "y": 89.32, "w": 4.01, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "and The", "x": 28.1, "y": 89.32, "w": 4.97, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Royal", "x": 33.08, "y": 89.32, "w": 3.85, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Navy who confirmed neither were aware of any", "x": 8.05, "y": 90.49, "w": 26.31, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "flares being released.", "x": 8.02, "y": 91.66, "w": 11.72, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "A", "x": 19.74, "y": 91.66, "w": 1.16, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "coastguard spokesman", "x": 20.9, "y": 91.66, "w": 13.44, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "said:\" In these cases it is always better to be safe", "x": 8.02, "y": 92.83, "w": 27.83, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "R", "x": 37.35, "y": 71.69, "w": 3.53, "h": 5.47, "fontSize": 37.9}, {"text": "than sorry, but it now appears as if the light", "x": 40.86, "y": 72.62, "w": 23.95, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "may have been a shooting star\".", "x": 40.92, "y": 73.83, "w": 18.01, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "It follows the sighting of three mysterious", "x": 40.92, "y": 76.21, "w": 22.81, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "bright red star-like objects seen over the air-", "x": 40.92, "y": 77.4, "w": 24.2, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "-", "x": 37.71, "y": 78.6, "w": 0.45, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "\u2014", "x": 38.67, "y": 78.6, "w": 1.16, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "port earlier that morning.", "x": 40.96, "y": 78.6, "w": 13.56, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "An", "x": 54.52, "y": 78.6, "w": 1.82, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Aberdeenshire", "x": 56.34, "y": 78.6, "w": 8.59, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "man who was travelling from Old Meldrum to the", "x": 38.23, "y": 79.79, "w": 27.11, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "airport just after 5;30am noticed what he described", "x": 38.2, "y": 80.98, "w": 28.36, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "as \"three bright red lights\" in the sky. His sighting", "x": 38.2, "y": 82.17, "w": 27.39, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "was backed up by employees at the airport, who", "x": 38.2, "y": 83.36, "w": 26.8, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "were also baffled by the sighting. The man, who", "x": 38.2, "y": 84.55, "w": 26.67, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "asked not to be named, said: \"I have never seen", "x": 38.23, "y": 85.74, "w": 26.48, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "anything like it, it's the first time", "x": 38.23, "y": 86.94, "w": 17.39, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "I", "x": 55.61, "y": 86.94, "w": 0.73, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "have witnessed", "x": 56.35, "y": 86.94, "w": 9.15, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "something so spectacular.\"", "x": 38.2, "y": 88.13, "w": 15.01, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "\"It wasn't a plane because two of the lights didn't", "x": 38.26, "y": 90.45, "w": 27.4, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "move and the third did move position-and it had", "x": 38.26, "y": 91.64, "w": 26.49, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "changed position again when I arrived at the airport.", "x": 38.23, "y": 92.83, "w": 28.84, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "It was really unexplainable because", "x": 68.22, "y": 72.6, "w": 19.4, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "I", "x": 87.62, "y": 72.6, "w": 0.71, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "don't think a", "x": 88.34, "y": 72.6, "w": 7.49, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "plane or helicopter could move that fast.\"", "x": 68.22, "y": 73.79, "w": 22.76, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "He mentioned the sighting to staff at the airport. By", "x": 68.25, "y": 76.19, "w": 28.23, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "this time there was only one light visible. One", "x": 68.19, "y": 77.38, "w": 25.36, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "employee said \"It just looked like a bright star but it", "x": 68.22, "y": 78.57, "w": 28.43, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "was red, it was also lower in the sky than you", "x": 68.19, "y": 79.77, "w": 25.3, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "would expect to see a star plus no other stars were", "x": 68.19, "y": 80.96, "w": 28.41, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "visible in that part of the sky.\"", "x": 68.19, "y": 82.15, "w": 16.46, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "The Met Office have ruled out any meteorological", "x": 68.19, "y": 84.57, "w": 27.18, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "link. A", "x": 68.25, "y": 85.74, "w": 3.55, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "spokesman explained if visibility had been", "x": 71.8, "y": 85.74, "w": 23.63, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "poor the particles in the air could have made the", "x": 68.25, "y": 86.91, "w": 26.94, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "lights look brighter but he said: \"It was certainly not", "x": 68.25, "y": 88.09, "w": 28.43, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "a weather phenomenon.\"", "x": 68.22, "y": 89.26, "w": 14.15, "h": 1.1, "fontSize": 8.2}, {"text": "Thanks to Brian Harwood of", "x": 80.21, "y": 92.14, "w": 13.73, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "Mastrick. Aberdeen for this report.", "x": 80.12, "y": 93.14, "w": 16.81, "h": 0.96, "fontSize": 7.2}, {"text": "35", "x": 94.61, "y": 96.89, "w": 2.36, "h": 1.34, "fontSize": 9.9}]}